{"id":"hoffnung","lemma":"Hoffnung","pos":"noun","rank":848,"glosses":["hope, the belief or expectation that something wished for can or will really happen.","hope, the actual thing wished for","hope, a person or thing that is a source of hope"],"ipa":"/ˈhɔfnʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/74/De-Hoffnung.ogg/De-Hoffnung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hoffnung","plural":"Hoffnungen"},"formAudio":{"Hoffnungen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Hoffnungen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben Hoffnung.","en":"We have hope.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},null]},{"text":"Er verliert manchmal die Hoffnung.","en":"He sometimes loses hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/592889","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to lose","l":"verlieren"},{"g":"sometimes"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe die Hoffnung verloren.","en":"I've lost hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/215601","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Mache dir nicht zu viele Hoffnungen!","en":"Don't get your hopes up too much.","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null]},{"text":"Das ist meine einzige Hoffnung.","en":"It's my only hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389075","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"only, sole","l":"einzig"},null]}]}